    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061110.0091\n\nCOLOMBO, Nov. 10 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nColombo stocks close down\n\n\n\n\nShare prices on the Colombo Stock Exchange closed lower on Friday, with the key Colombo All Share Price Index decreasing by 15.14 points to close at 2,564.81 points.\n\nThe highly capitalized Milanka Price Index also decreased by 34. 58 points to close at 3,334.13 points.\n\nA total turnover of 385 million rupees (about 3.85 million U.S. dollars) was recorded during the day with a volume of 14 million shares being traded.",
